  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Shimmer Sweep\n\nA bright shine travels once across muted text, left to right: a refined metallic gleam that draws attention to text already on screen. It does not animate the text in.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 4 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- Highlighting a product name or pricing tier with a metallic gleam on a premium slide.\n- The text is already visible and you want an attention effect rather than an entrance.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The text needs to enter the scene: use tracking-in or soft-blur-in first, then layer a shimmer.\n- The tone is casual or energetic: use spring-scale-in or staggered-fade-up.\n- You want per-character colour control: the sweep is one beam.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Text, default \"Generating\"\n- base_color (color): Base color, default \"#3f3f46\"\n- shine_color (color): Shine color, default \"#fafafa\"\n- font_size (number, 12-260): Font size, default 96\n- font_weight (enum): Font weight, default \"700\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Shimmer Sweep\n\n  A bright shine travels once across muted text: a metallic gleam that draws the eye to text that\n  is already on screen.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/Remocn/remocn/blob/126221ae00ba86eb40b65731b125ff398687d3b7/registry/remocn/shimmer-sweep/index.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) 2026 Remocn\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"shimmer-sweep\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"4\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    { \"id\": \"text\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Text\", \"description\": \"Text the shine travels across.\", \"default\": \"Generating\" },\n    { \"id\": \"base_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Base color\", \"description\": \"Dim color of the text underneath the shine.\", \"default\": \"#3f3f46\" },\n    { \"id\": \"shine_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Shine color\", \"description\": \"Color of the moving highlight.\", \"default\": \"#fafafa\" },\n    { \"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. Longer text shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 96, \"min\": 12, \"max\": 260, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\" },\n    { \"id\": \"font_weight\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font weight\", \"description\": \"Weight of the text.\", \"default\": \"700\", \"options\": [{ \"value\": \"400\", \"label\": \"Regular\" }, { \"value\": \"500\", \"label\": \"Medium\" }, { \"value\": \"600\", \"label\": \"Semibold\" }, { \"value\": \"700\", \"label\": \"Bold\" }] },\n    { \"id\": \"speed\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Speed\", \"description\": \"Playback speed multiplier. The shine crosses in the first 80 % of the block at speed 1.\", \"default\": 1, \"min\": 0.25, \"max\": 4, \"step\": 0.05, \"unit\": \"x\" }\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Shimmer Sweep</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          font-family: var(--font-display, Geist, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif);\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .shs-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .shs-wrap { position: relative; display: inline-block; }\n        .shs-text { display: block; margin: 0; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; white-space: nowrap; }\n        .shs-shine {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          color: transparent;\n          -webkit-background-clip: text;\n          background-clip: text;\n          background-size: 200% 100%;\n          background-repeat: no-repeat;\n        }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"shimmer-sweep\" data-duration=\"4\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"shs-clip\" class=\"shs-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"4\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div id=\"shs-wrap\" class=\"shs-wrap\">\n            <span id=\"shs-base\" class=\"shs-text\"></span>\n            <span id=\"shs-shine\" class=\"shs-text shs-shine\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars =\n              window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables\n                ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables()\n                : {};\n            function num(value, fallback, min, max) {\n              var n = Number(value);\n              return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : fallback;\n            }\n            function str(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function pick(value, list, fallback) {\n              return list.indexOf(String(value)) >= 0 ? String(value) : fallback;\n            }\n            function col(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value.trim() : fallback;\n            }\n            function ip(f, a, b, from, to) {\n              var p = b === a ? 1 : Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (f - a) / (b - a)));\n              return from + (to - from) * p;\n            }\n\n            var text = str(vars.text, \"Generating\");\n            var baseColor = col(vars.base_color, \"#3f3f46\");\n            var shineColor = col(vars.shine_color, \"#fafafa\");\n            var weight = pick(vars.font_weight, [\"400\", \"500\", \"600\", \"700\"], \"700\");\n            var speed = num(vars.speed, 1, 0.25, 4);\n\n            var wrap = document.getElementById(\"shs-wrap\");\n            var base = document.getElementById(\"shs-base\");\n            var shine = document.getElementById(\"shs-shine\");\n            base.textContent = shine.textContent = text;\n            base.style.color = baseColor;\n            base.style.fontWeight = shine.style.fontWeight = weight;\n            shine.style.backgroundImage = \"linear-gradient(110deg, transparent 30%, \" + shineColor + \" 50%, transparent 70%)\";\n\n            var size = num(vars.font_size, 96, 12, 260);\n            base.style.fontSize = shine.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n            var maxWidth = Math.max(1, root.clientWidth * 0.9);\n            if (wrap.scrollWidth > maxWidth) {\n              size = Math.max(12, size * (maxWidth / wrap.scrollWidth));\n              base.style.fontSize = shine.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n            }\n\n            // remocn: the gradient's background-position runs linearly from 200 % to -100 % over\n            // the first 80 % of the composition, so the shine crosses the text once, left to right.\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"4\");\n            var durationFrames = total * 30;\n            function draw(frame) {\n              var position = ip(frame, 0, durationFrames * 0.8, 200, -100);\n              shine.style.backgroundPosition = position + \"% 50%\";\n            }\n\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            tl.to(clock, { t: total, duration: total, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t * 30 * speed); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n            tl.seek(0);\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"shimmer-sweep\"] = tl;\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
